    "title": "Mystic Slots\u00ae - Casino Games",
    "description": "Mystic Lake Casino brings you the all new Casino app Mystic Slots, where you can play all of your favorite casino games anytime, anywhere - all for FREE!  Download the all new Mystic Slots and choose from 100+ slots, video poker, blackjack, roulette, keno, bingo and much, much more.  Download to receive a FREE COIN welcome bonus and start experiencing all the fun of a Las Vegas casino in the palm of your hand!\r\n\r\nWhy Mystic Slots?\r\n\r\n100+ EXCITING FREE SLOTS RIGHT FROM YOUR CASINO FLOOR:\r\n\r\n-       Gaming Arts - Pinatas Ole \r\n-       AGS - Rakin\u2019 Bacon \r\n-       Konami - China Shores \r\n-       Lightning Box - 100x RA \r\n-       Aruze - Flaming Chilies \r\n\r\n\r\nPLAY MORE 50+ FREE VIDEO POKER GAMES\r\n-       Choose from CLASSIC video poker titles like  Jokers Wild, Jacks or Better, Double Double Bonus Poker, Deuces Wild and more!\r\n-       Explore popular MULTI-PLAY video poker games from Double Bonus Deuces Wild to Joker\u2019s Wild or Double Double Bonus Poker and play up to 25 hands at once for even bigger jackpots!\r\n-       Play over 15 varieties of Multi-Rise Video Poker, from Trio Joker\u2019s Wild to Jacks or Better and Trio Super Double Double Bonus Poker.\r\n\r\nHOW ABOUT CASINO CLASSICS?\r\n-        Play Lucky Roulette, Three Hand Blackjack, Blazing Bets Blackjack or High Roller Blackjack!\r\n-        Love Bingo? Daub away up to four cards at one time! \r\n-        How about Keno? How about exciting titles like Count Dracula Keno, Lucky Cherry Keno and Leprechaun Love Keno\r\n\r\nEARN FREE COINS\r\n-        Level up to unlock more slots and earn more free coins!\r\n-        Play with friends to test your luck and earn more free coins!\r\n-        Earn Daily Bonuses and Bi-Hourly Bonuses\r\n\r\nSPIN AND WIN IN LIVE SLOT TOURNAMENTS\r\n\u2022        Hourly live slot tournaments take place three times a week!\r\n\u2022        All bets during the tournament are FREE!\r\n\u2022        Win HUGE coin bonuses in the top 3 leaderboard positions!\r\n\r\nCOMPETE IN DAILY QUESTS\r\n-        Complete daily quests to earn more coins, WIN awesome prizes or fill up your weekly progress bar\r\n-        Fill your weekly progress bar to WIN a 2X BONUS wheel spins\r\n-        New quests available every day!\r\n\r\nMORE FUN and FEATURES\r\n-        Play against others in our interactive Link Lounge for even more chances to win big!\r\n-        New slots and fan favorite classic slots are featured every week! Discover something new by exploring featured video poker, blackjack, and keno games!\r\n-        Become a VIP for access to new slots as well as additional bonuses and benefits!\r\n\r\nLike Mystic Slots on Facebook for even  more chances at free coins\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/MysticSlots\r\n\r\nWild-Tiles and Gems Wild-Tiles are trademarks of Case Venture Management, LLC.\r\nMulti-Rise Video Poker\u2122 is a trademark of Oddworks.\r\n\r\nView our privacy policy at: https://www.mysticslots.com/privacy-policy/\r\n \r\nView our Terms of service at: https://www.mysticslots.com/privacy-policy/\r\n\r\nMystic Slots\u00ae is intended for players 21+ (18+ in Minnesota) for entertainment purposes only and does not offer real money gambling or any opportunity to win real money through game play. Playing Mystic Slots\u00ae does not entail future success at real money gaming.\r\nDo not sell my data: Mystic Slots\u00ae shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://www.mysticslots.com/privacy-policy/. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help center or by emailing support@mysticslots.com",
